      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 20000
    },
    "imphow": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 9830,
      "w": 1400,
      "text": "Choose one client folder with a subfolder per company. Each company folder gets its own agent, a few running at a time (Settings: Companies read at a time). An agent reads only its folder, suggests values for that one company with the file and page they came from, sets aside files about another company, and asks only where files disagree or something is missing. Nothing is saved until a person applies a company; share entries go in as drafts and the opening review stays with someone else. Entry point: an Import records button on the Companies page.",
      "fill": "blue"
    }
